WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:03.767
♪♪

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.400
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.434
Government regulators
on Friday

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:09.501
seized control
of Silicon Valley Bank,

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:11.834
the country's 16th largest bank,

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:15.868
after it quickly became
the 178th largest bank.

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:17.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:19.834
That's right,
government regulators on Friday

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:22.100
seized control
of Silicon Valley Bank,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.334
making it the largest
U.S. bank failure since 2008.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:26.601
And come to think of it,

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:30.000
it was always a bad sign
that their ATM had a tip screen.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.868
President Biden spoke
this morning

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.267
about Friday's collapse
of Silicon Valley Bank

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:38.300
and reassured Americans

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.300
the country's financial system
is safe.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.601
But, remember, this is a guy
whose whole financial system

00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:46.334
is definitely a coffee can
on a high shelf.

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:47.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:51.200
"See, the thing is, they never
look up there."

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.334
That's right. President Biden
reassured Americans

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:55.067
the country's
financial system is safe.

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:56.501
Okay, I think the fact

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:58.701
that you're talking
about a bank collapse

00:00:58.701 --> 00:00:59.701
proves it isn't.

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:02.000
That's like going to a funeral

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.133
and giving a eulogy about
how Nana's gonna be fine.

00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:07.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:10.501
The Oscars were held
last night,

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:12.601
and the film "Everything
Everywhere All at Once"

00:01:12.601 --> 00:01:14.901
won seven awards,
including Best Picture.

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:17.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.767
Best Picture, Best Actress,

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:22.567
and worst butchering
in a text from your mom.

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:24.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:29.300
That's right. "Everything
Everywhere All at Once"

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.601
won best picture at last
night's Academy Awards.

00:01:31.601 --> 00:01:34.868
As for who lost -- whoever sat
behind this lady.

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:36.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.434
"Oh, my goodness.

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:42.133
My first Oscars.
My first Oscars."

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:48.400
When asked last week
about allegations

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.367
that he participated
in a credit-card skimming scam,

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:53.000
New York Congressman
George Santos said

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.234
he was innocent and added,
"I'm no mastermind of anything,"

00:01:56.234 --> 00:02:00.200
which is maybe the first
believable thing he's ever said.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:05.367
Elon Musk is reportedly
planning to build a town

00:02:05.367 --> 00:02:09.167
outside Austin, Texas, for his
Tesla and SpaceX employees

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:12.067
that he has described
in meetings as a utopia.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.100
I don't know.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.567
Have you ever been to a party

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:17.167
where one guy has a Tesla?

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:19.701
Now imagine every guy
has a Tesla.

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:21.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.501
A tattoo artist in India

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:24.100
recently set
a Guinness world record

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.434
after spending
over 90 consecutive hours

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:28.400
giving tattoos to 64 people

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.033
and hepatitis to 63 people.

00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:33.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.100
Today was National K9
Veterans Day.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:42.634
It's like regular Veterans Day,
except no fireworks.

00:02:42.634 --> 00:02:44.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.100
We have a writer, Mike Scollins,

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:54.033
who's obsessed with the idea
that dogs don't like fireworks.

00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:57.834
A lot of his jokes are dependent
upon people knowing that.

00:02:57.834 --> 00:02:59.000
And caring.

00:03:00.734 --> 00:03:02.767
And finally, according to
a new study,

00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:06.200
reusable water bottles
can have 14 times more bacteria

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.234
than a pet's water bowl,

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:09.434
but only because your cat drinks
out of it

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:11.000
every time you turn your back.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.667 --> 00:03:15.767
President Biden signed
an executive order today

00:03:15.767 --> 00:03:18.534
that increases background checks
on gun purchases.

00:03:18.534 --> 00:03:20.300
From now on, gun dealers

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.434
are gonna ask your first
and last name.

00:03:23.434 --> 00:03:25.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.601 --> 00:03:27.501
Republican presidential hopeful
Nikki Haley

00:03:27.501 --> 00:03:29.267
said on Sunday that taxpayers

00:03:29.267 --> 00:03:32.434
"should absolutely not bail out
Silicon Valley Bank."

00:03:32.434 --> 00:03:34.300
But I think that's
largely because

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.033
it's polling ahead of her.

00:03:36.033 --> 00:03:38.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:40.601
The Pentagon said today
that a Russian jet

00:03:40.601 --> 00:03:43.968
crashed into a U.S. military
drone over the Black Sea.

00:03:43.968 --> 00:03:46.267
And I think I speak for
all Americans when I say,

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.501
probably an accident, right?

00:03:47.501 --> 00:03:50.767
This doesn't have to be
a whole thing.

00:03:50.767 --> 00:03:52.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.767 --> 00:03:54.167
Just go with accident.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:55.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.434 --> 00:03:57.067
Russia is reportedly
restoring hundreds

00:03:57.067 --> 00:04:00.501
of decades-old Soviet tanks
to use against Ukraine

00:04:00.501 --> 00:04:02.534
amid a shortage of weapons
and equipment.

00:04:02.534 --> 00:04:03.868
Oh, they are struggling.

00:04:03.868 --> 00:04:05.834
Next it's just gonna be,

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:08.901
"Any way to trick out
these T-shirt cannons?"

00:04:08.901 --> 00:04:10.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.801 --> 00:04:12.701
Fox News host Brian Kilmeade

00:04:12.701 --> 00:04:15.234
interviewed Florida governor
Ron DeSantis over the weekend

00:04:15.234 --> 00:04:17.167
