while wearing suits.

00:04:17.167 --> 00:04:19.501
It kind of ruined the flow
of the interview, though.

00:04:19.501 --> 00:04:22.834
"So, Governor, what do you think
the U.S. role should be

00:04:22.834 --> 00:04:24.767
in the war in --
Oh, wait, car!"

00:04:24.767 --> 00:04:26.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.834 --> 00:04:32.901
That's right, Fox News aired
an interview over the weekend

00:04:32.901 --> 00:04:34.667
where host Brian Kilmeade
played catch

00:04:34.667 --> 00:04:36.200
with Florida governor
Ron DeSantis

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.133
