in Iowa.

00:04:38.133 --> 00:04:39.968
And no surprise here,
their fathers chose

00:04:39.968 --> 00:04:42.801
not to come out of the corn
and reconnect with them.

00:04:42.801 --> 00:04:44.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:54.868
Democrats are reportedly worried
that efforts to ban TikTok

00:04:54.868 --> 00:04:56.968
could make it harder
to reach young voters.

00:04:56.968 --> 00:04:58.734
Well, you could do
what Republicans do

00:04:58.734 --> 00:05:00.300
and reach them on Venmo.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.968
[ Laughter ]

