00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:14.100
[ Laughter ]

00:12:20.067 --> 00:12:23.067
-So, our writer, Mike Scollins,
submitted that joke.

00:12:23.067 --> 00:12:24.801
And, look,
we didn't have to do it.

00:12:24.801 --> 00:12:25.934
[ Laughter ]

00:12:25.934 --> 00:12:27.567
You know,
I'm the host of the show.

00:12:27.567 --> 00:12:28.934
I could have just said
we're not doing it,

00:12:28.934 --> 00:12:30.501
but I wanted to do it
because I'm trying to teach him

00:12:30.501 --> 00:12:32.534
a lesson and --

00:12:32.534 --> 00:12:34.000
[ Laughter ]

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:38.033
There's no -- The undergirding
logic of that makes no sense.

00:12:38.033 --> 00:12:40.667
That -- That implies
that everybody

00:12:40.667 --> 00:12:44.234
who's had a less-popular dog
until today

00:12:44.234 --> 00:12:45.801
had to put their dogs down.

00:12:45.801 --> 00:12:49.100
It doesn't -- Just 'cause the --
[ Sighs ]

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.467
The important thing is,
you know,

00:12:50.467 --> 00:12:52.434
it's the start of the show,
you want to kick it off,

00:12:52.434 --> 00:12:54.033
you want to get a good vibe
in the room,

00:12:54.033 --> 00:12:56.033
and we showed a clip
from "Old Yeller," so...

00:12:56.033 --> 00:12:58.534
[ Laughter ]

00:12:58.534 --> 00:13:00.701
And, finally,
longtime Green Bay Packers

00:13:00.701 --> 00:13:03.267
quarterback Aaron Rodgers
said yesterday that it is

00:13:03.267 --> 00:13:06.033
his intention to play next
season for the New York Jets.

00:13:06.033 --> 00:13:08.567
It's a perfect fit
because every week the Jets

00:13:08.567 --> 00:13:10.968
go out there intending
to play football.

00:13:10.968 --> 00:13:14.267
And that -- That's what's
waitin' for you here, buddy.

00:13:14.267 --> 00:13:15.968
That was a monologue.

00:13:15.968 --> 00:13:19.968
♪♪

